<title>UK: London gold fixes firmer on fresh covering.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes firmer on fresh covering.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $328.25 vs $326.00 previously. Spurred by further short covering in New York, firmer PGMs. $330.00 possible target.</p>
<p>SILVER - Firmer with gold at $4.34/$4.36 up seven cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up on continuing delay in Russian exports.</p>
<p>$419.00/$422.50, up $7.50. Tightening.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also tight. $198.00/$201.00, up $9.50.</p>
</text>
